# DRAW keymap preset: gimp (STARTER)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods   (mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt)
# Action ids are in SHORTCUTS.md / GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init). Example — Fill on G:
#   103 103 0 7
#
# DRAW already matches most pixel-art conventions (B brush, E eraser, L line,
# M marquee, I picker, V move, Z zoom, T text), so only the genuine gimp
# differences belong here. Some foreign keys collide with DRAW chords (e.g. G is
# a grid chord) — those are deliberate tradeoffs to confirm before adding.
# Rows below are applied as user overrides; unmapped actions keep DRAW defaults.
